# Specification Section 24 requires LF line terminators in every text artifact the tool
# produces, and Appendix C requires LF in every conformance fixture. Normalizing in the
# working tree as well as in the index keeps fixtures byte-exact on Windows checkouts.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.nupkg binary
*.snupkg binary

# Conformance fixtures are compared byte-for-byte and must never be transformed.
conformance/** -text
tests/**/fixtures/** -text